message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "A 股资金稳态地形的马尔可夫链建模与证伪"
abstract: "Reproduction, institutional adaptation, and falsification of the MarketRank Markov-chain pipeline (arXiv:2610.08946) on China's A-share market. 2,000 stocks over 60 trading days, rendered as a zero-build WebGL terrain. Three-tier result, two of which are negative: the apparent reversal signal is a disguised size effect. Every figure is recomputable in 32 seconds from the committed data."
